{"name":"Fantasy Romance","hex":"#e83a72","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"fantasy","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["That which comes from one's imagination or the act of imagining things.","The literary genre generally dealing with themes of magic and the supernatural, imaginary worlds and creatures, etc."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To conceive (something) mentally; to imagine.\n To fantasize about (something).","To conceive (something) mentally; to imagine."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/fantasy"},{"term":"romance","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An intimate relationship between two people; a love affair.","A strong obsession or attachment for something or someone."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To woo; to court.","To write or tell romantic stories, poetry, letters, etc."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/romance"}],"entries":[{"title":"Fantasy Romance","blocks":[{"text":"Fantasy Romance is a 1991 Hong Kong romantic fantasy comedy film directed by Taylor Wong and starring Joey Wong, Tony Leung and Deanie Ip."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/3/3c/FantasyRomance.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fantasy_Romance","wikidata":"Q20649142"},{"title":"Romantic fantasy","blocks":[{"text":"Romantic fantasy, or \"romantasy\", is a subgenre of the broader genres of fantasy fiction and romance fiction that combines fantasy and romance, bringing to fantasy many of the elements and conventions of the romance genre. One of the key features of romantic fantasy involves the focus on relationships: social, political, and romantic."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Romantic_fantasy","wikidata":"Q930383"},{"title":"Fantasy","blocks":[{"text":"Fantasy is a genre of speculative fiction that involves supernatural or magical elements, often including completely imaginary realms and creatures."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/be/The_Whirlwind_Seizes_the_Wreath.jpg/330px-The_Whirlwind_Seizes_the_Wreath.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fantasy","wikidata":"Q132311"},{"title":"Romance","blocks":[{"text":"Romance and romantic love encompass a number of ideas about love, which are interrelated for historical and cultural reasons:"},{"items":["passionate feelings of attraction—a mental state of \"being in love\", with focused attention (salience) towards a specific individual for courtship or pair bonding;","the cultural practice or idealization of initiating intimate relationships for feelings like these, over more practical or ordinary concerns;","a relationship or love affair initiated or maintained this way, which may be premarital or absent a commitment; and","a love story involving these elements."]}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/89/Frank_Bernard_Dicksee_-_Romeo_and_Juliet%2C_1884.jpg/330px-Frank_Bernard_Dicksee_-_Romeo_and_Juliet%2C_1884.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Romance","wikidata":"Q1189047"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Li_Song-Skeleton_Fantasy_Show.jpg/500px-Li_Song-Skeleton_Fantasy_Show.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Li_Song-Skeleton_Fantasy_Show.jpg/1280px-Li_Song-Skeleton_Fantasy_Show.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Li_Song-Skeleton_Fantasy_Show.jpg/500px-Li_Song-Skeleton_Fantasy_Show.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Painting Skeleton Fantasy Show (骷髏幻戲圖) by Li Song (1190–1264)","link":"https://en.wikipedia